su name example meta be map def
su name required ob ve text "PYA_MIND_TOOL" "OLLAMA_HOST" ya
prah

from filename "../../module/saddle_tools.pya" ob name saddle tools to name saddle tools be import do

exists su name coding loop system ob text "You are a local coding assistant. Use command and repair tools. Keep output concise." ya
exists su name coding loop be mind as name "gpt-oss:latest" fromtext name coding loop system ya

su name verify loop configure be map def
su name guarantee command ob text quoted.text.node examples/out/coding-loop-primes.js | tail -n 1 | grep -q '^541$' && printf ok.text.quoted ya
su name guarantee expect regex ob text "^ok$" ya
prah

ob text "Create examples/out/coding-loop-primes.js. The program must compute the 100th prime using a loop (no external libraries), print each found prime on its own line, and print the final prime again as the last line. Use command to run and validate. Use repair if needed. Reply only with the final file path." for name coding loop with name saddle tools atleast num 0.8 atmost num 4 to name text output be verify loop do

ob name output be write do
